    "text": "```python\ndef prod_signsprod_signs(arr):\n    if not arr:\n        return None\n\n    total = 0\n\n    num_signs = 0\n    for num in arr:\n        if num < < 0:\n            total += num * num_signs\n        else else:\n            num_signs += 1\n\n    if num_sign_signs == 1:\n        total *= 1\n    elif num_sign_signs == 2:\n        total *= -1\n    else:\n        total *= 0\n\n    return total\n```\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n",
